{"ID":"20250922163105-fuf75zb","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250922163105-fuf75zb","title":"UPL6-7——手动合并网格","type":"doc","updated":"20250926115933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922194924-vlg02ne","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250922194924-vlg02ne","updated":"20250926114604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250922194924-os6sto7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194924-os6sto7","updated":"20250922194934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前置知识："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240317220544-aihpc4z","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UED——Unity编辑器拓展"}]}]},{"ID":"20250926114604-fvlj2ku","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250926114604-fvlj2ku","updated":"20250926115933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250926114611-7wdzkqk","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250926114611-7wdzkqk","updated":"20250926115933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"CombineInstance\t\t\t\t\t// 网格实例化参数\nCombineInstance.mesh\t\t\t// 网格属性\nCombineInstance.subMeshIndex\t// 使用的子网格索引\nCombineInstance.transform\t\t// 将网格的顶点变换到某个空间坐标系下的4*4空间变换矩阵\ntransform.worldToLocalMatrix\t// 获取可以将点从世界空间转换到本地空间的矩阵\ntransform.localToWorldMatrix\t// 获取可以将点从本地空间转换到世界空间的矩阵\nmesh.vertexCount\t\t\t\t// 获取网格的顶点数量\nmesh.indexFormat\t\t\t\t// 网格的索引格式，可以是uint16或uint32，默认是uint16\nIndexFormat.UInt16\t\t\t\t// uint16的索引格式，它使得网格最多可支持65535个顶点\nIndexFormat.UInt32\t\t\t\t// uint32的所有格式，它使得网格最多可支持42亿个顶点\nmesh.CombineMeshes()\t\t\t// 合并网格，需要传入需要被合并网格的CombineInstance数据，是否合并为单个子网格，是否应用CombineInstance的空间变换矩阵，是否包含光照贴图数据\nmesh.RecalculateBounds()\t\t// 重新计算网格的包围盒信息\nmesh.RecalculateNormals()\t\t// 重新计算网格的法线信息，顶点发生合并变化并且需要用法线贴图时需要重新算\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250922163105-tjxvaoc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250922163105-tjxvaoc","updated":"20250923103943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要手动合并网格"}]},{"ID":"20250922163125-y7k9sw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163125-y7k9sw0","updated":"20250923103943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态批处理虽然可以帮助我们自动合并静态物体，\n但是它会保留原始网格，会增加内存开销，并且动态创建的对象，也不会自动进行静态批处理\n而我们自己手动来合并网格，不仅可以减少 DrawCall，还可以解决这些问题："}]},{"ID":"20250922163203-rltzcd2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-rltzcd2","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163203-x92kk07","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-x92kk07","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163203-5cpn58f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-5cpn58f","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以自己合并网格后，销毁原网格，节省内存"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163203-6je7ylv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-6je7ylv","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163203-7yztyh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-7yztyh1","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态创建的对象，可以通过我们自己来控制网格合并"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163203-jhdnaai","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-jhdnaai","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163203-o478xut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-o478xut","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以整体变换（移动、旋转、缩放）合并后的网格对象"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163203-vri0wkj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-vri0wkj","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163203-4b03yzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163203-4b03yzj","updated":"20250922163203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们甚至可以再拓展一下，自己合并材质和网格，让不同材质之间的物体也能一起处理"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163201-699qwk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163201-699qwk7","updated":"20250922163201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总的来说，手动合并网格比起静态批处理更加的灵活可控"}]},{"ID":"20250922163207-55l97wv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250922163207-55l97wv","updated":"20250926114640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并网格的必备知识"}]},{"ID":"20250922163322-5vj056b","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163322-5vj056b","updated":"20250926114640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163327-7vkjqr0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163327-7vkjqr0","name":"mesh.CombineMeshes()","updated":"20250926114640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163327-15ov0ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163327-15ov0ar","updated":"20250926114640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网格合并方法"}]},{"ID":"20250922163328-2smuzvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163328-2smuzvd","updated":"20250923104113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250104125104-2sqdmhw","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Mesh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CombineMeshes"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 方法"}]},{"ID":"20250923111445-xvc376n","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250923111445-xvc376n","updated":"20250923111552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"void CombineMeshes(CombineInstance[] combine, bool mergeSubMeshes = true, bool useMatrices = true, bool hasLightmapData = false)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250922163435-0e06w45","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163435-0e06w45","updated":"20250923111830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163435-9t0sjhi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163435-9t0sjhi","updated":"20250923111830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163435-f0hhlvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163435-f0hhlvx","updated":"20250923111557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数1："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"combine"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示合并实例数组"}]},{"ID":"20250922163440-50m7i2u","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163440-50m7i2u","updated":"20250923111830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163440-begxzyx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163440-begxzyx","name":"CombineInstance","updated":"20250923111830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163440-tr6xo0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163440-tr6xo0k","updated":"20250922194144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CombineInstance"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 实例化参数"}]},{"ID":"20250922163445-prte34v","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163445-prte34v","updated":"20250922194447"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163445-ntqi5ev","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163445-ntqi5ev","updated":"20250922163445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163445-5w2laid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163445-5w2laid","updated":"20250923111747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"属性 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mesh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Mesh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 要合并的网格"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163446-apwea71","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163446-apwea71","updated":"20250922163446"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163446-8q78w7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163446-8q78w7p","updated":"20250923111806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"属性 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"subMeshIndex"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 使用的子网格索引"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163447-13zzk0d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163447-13zzk0d","updated":"20250922194447"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163447-eeqq0ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163447-eeqq0ml","updated":"20250923111822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"属性 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Matrix4x4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 空间变换矩阵"}]},{"ID":"20250922163450-5z93c5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163450-5z93c5c","updated":"20250922194441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般用传入："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"父对象.worldToLocalMatrix * 子对象.localToWorldMatrix"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 用于将子网格顶点从子对象本地空间转换到父对象的本地空间"}]},{"ID":"20250922194441-3jrvv94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194441-3jrvv94","updated":"20250922194447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中：\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"父对象.worldToLocalMatrix"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示将点从世界空间转换到父对象本地空间\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"子对象.localToWorldMatrix"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示将点从子对象本地空间转换到世界空间"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163437-8i0lisy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163437-8i0lisy","updated":"20250923111605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163437-ysbzqsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163437-ysbzqsc","updated":"20250923111605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数2："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mergeSubMeshes"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示是否合并为单个子网格，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"true"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 合并为单个子网格（需要相同材质）、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"false"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 保留多个子网格(可不同材质)"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163437-pild39j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163437-pild39j","updated":"20250923111610"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163437-nw9jkcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163437-nw9jkcc","updated":"20250923111610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数3："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"useMatrices"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示是否应用变换矩阵，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"true"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 将保持空间位置"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163438-skkokob","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163438-skkokob","updated":"20250923111616"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163438-wjxl718","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163438-wjxl718","updated":"20250923111616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数4："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hasLightmapData"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示是否包含光照贴图数据"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922163327-s7nndxk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163327-s7nndxk","updated":"20250922194556"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922163327-xgp1pk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922163327-xgp1pk0","updated":"20250922163327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并网格流程"}]},{"ID":"20250922163331-fg3ikxo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922163331-fg3ikxo","updated":"20250922194556"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182836-rsynkw8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182836-rsynkw8","updated":"20250922182836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182836-btbjiwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182836-btbjiwp","updated":"20250922182838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"获取想要合并的网格的网格数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922182838-jje40up","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182838-jje40up","updated":"20250922194304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182838-0vnm31x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182838-0vnm31x","updated":"20250922194304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根据网格数据实例化对应个数的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CombineInstance"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 对象"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922182840-7j7t0fl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182840-7j7t0fl","updated":"20250922194556"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182840-9ahgppo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182840-9ahgppo","updated":"20250922194556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建一个新的网格对象，并设置顶点索引格式（用于将子网格顶点从子对象本地空间转换到父对象的本地空间）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922182842-933f5z1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182842-933f5z1","updated":"20250922182904"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182842-o5jxmm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182842-o5jxmm2","updated":"20250922182904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CombineMeshes"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 方法，传入 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CombineInstance"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 数组和相关参数进行网格合并"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922182843-gd4mck1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182843-gd4mck1","updated":"20250922182847"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182843-t2br97t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182843-t2br97t","updated":"20250922182845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得到对应网格后重新计算法线和包围盒等数据"}]},{"ID":"20250922182847-6avtk1d","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182847-6avtk1d","updated":"20250922182847"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182847-5koyjta","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182847-5koyjta","updated":"20250922182847"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182847-r8aulu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182847-r8aulu1","updated":"20250922182847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"包围盒：一定要重新算"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922182848-kvqhlak","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182848-kvqhlak","updated":"20250922182848"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182848-w7yrlyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182848-w7yrlyg","updated":"20250922182848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"法线、切线：顶点发生合并变化并且需要用法线贴图时需要重新算"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922182846-nwuy9r6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20250922182846-nwuy9r6","updated":"20250922182846"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922182846-5ar7shi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922182846-5ar7shi","updated":"20250922182846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得到合并后的网格即可根据需求使用它"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250923110105-ydhh03g","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250923110105-ydhh03g","updated":"20250923110115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using UnityEngine;\n\npublic class Lesson46 : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    private void Start()\n    {\n        CombineMesh();\n    }\n\n    private void CombineMesh()\n    {\n        // 获取想要合并的Mesh\n        MeshFilter[] meshFilters = GetComponentsInChildren\u003cMeshFilter\u003e();\n        \n        // 实例化对应的CombineInstance结构体对象数组\n        CombineInstance[] combines = new CombineInstance[meshFilters.Length];\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c meshFilters.Length; i++)\n        {\n            // 得到想要的合并的网格信息\n            combines[i].mesh = meshFilters[i].sharedMesh;\n            // 将子网格的顶点位置从当前本地空间转换为父对象的本地空间\n            combines[i].transform = this.transform.worldToLocalMatrix * meshFilters[i].transform.localToWorldMatrix;\n            Destroy(meshFilters[i].gameObject);\n        }\n\n        // 创建新网格并合并网格\n        Mesh mesh = new();\n        // indexFormat属性默认是Uint16，代表最多支持65535个顶点，如果超过65535个顶点，则此参数一定要设置为Int32\n        int totalVertices = 0;\n        foreach (var item in combines)\n        {\n            totalVertices += item.mesh.vertexCount;\n        }\n        if (totalVertices \u003e 65535)\n        {\n            mesh.indexFormat = UnityEngine.Rendering.IndexFormat.UInt32;\n        }\n        mesh.CombineMeshes(combines, true, true, false);\n        // 重新计算网格的包围盒和法线\n        mesh.RecalculateBounds();\n        mesh.RecalculateNormals();\n        // 渲染合并后的网格\n        MeshFilter filter = this.gameObject.AddComponent\u003cMeshFilter\u003e();\n        filter.mesh = mesh;\n        MeshRenderer renderer = this.gameObject.AddComponent\u003cMeshRenderer\u003e();\n        renderer.material = meshFilters[0].GetComponent\u003cMeshRenderer\u003e().sharedMaterial;\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250923110121-vcn4ben","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250923110121-vcn4ben","updated":"20250923110941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并前："}]},{"ID":"20250923110132-lb95hgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250923110132-lb95hgj","updated":"20250923110920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250923110920-jsly021.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250923110311-nqv2bjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250923110311-nqv2bjh","updated":"20250923110947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并后："}]},{"ID":"20250923110948-ut2jn4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250923110948-ut2jn4a","updated":"20250923111042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250923111042-ug3py4t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250923111045-aiwca00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250923111045-aiwca00","updated":"20250923112110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以看到，网格被合并了，子物体也被销毁，同时 Batch 数量也有效的得到了降低，而且合并的网格对象可以整体的移动，旋转，缩放"}]},{"ID":"20250922194625-p0x55e2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250922194625-p0x55e2","updated":"20250926112841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存储合并的网络"}]},{"ID":"20250922194839-zhkoyzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194839-zhkoyzo","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上文是在运行时合并网格，有时候在实际开发中，我们有时可能需要在开发时就合并网格，并将其存储下来\n这样可以减小在运行时合并的开销，因此我们可以基于上文的代码进行修改，将合并后的网格直接作为资源文件存储下来，然后自行决定如何使用"}]},{"ID":"20250922194938-g7c3uwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194938-g7c3uwt","updated":"20250922194938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要流程：要将合并网格功能作为编辑器功能"}]},{"ID":"20250922194913-4a2d4kc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-4a2d4kc","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922194913-toy4cpt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-toy4cpt","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922194913-u3zlokl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-u3zlokl","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加功能入口"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922194913-gk0aagq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-gk0aagq","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922194913-1k9sy1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-1k9sy1g","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"获取选中对象"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922194913-hz1ryyf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-hz1ryyf","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922194913-g4ua1oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-g4ua1oy","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并选中对象的子对象中的网格"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922194913-tlspt8a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-tlspt8a","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922194913-9bifahk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922194913-9bifahk","updated":"20250922194913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存储网格"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250926111908-zo1m1bv","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250926111908-zo1m1bv","updated":"20250926111922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using System.IO;\nusing UnityEditor;\nusing UnityEngine;\n\npublic class CombineMeshEditor : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    [MenuItem(\"Tools/Mesh/合并所选对象子物体网格\")]\n    public static void CombineMesh()\n    {\n        // 获取当前在窗口选择的GameObject\n        GameObject obj = Selection.activeGameObject;\n        if (obj == null)\n        {\n            Debug.LogError(\"你没有选择任何GameObject\");\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // 获取想要合并的Mesh\n        MeshFilter[] meshFilters = obj.GetComponentsInChildren\u003cMeshFilter\u003e();\n        if (meshFilters.Length == 0)\n        {\n            Debug.LogError(\"你选择的GameObject下的子对象没有MeshFilter\");\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // 实例化对应的CombineInstance结构体对象数组\n        CombineInstance[] combines = new CombineInstance[meshFilters.Length];\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c meshFilters.Length; i++)\n        {\n            // 得到想要的合并的网格信息\n            combines[i].mesh = meshFilters[i].sharedMesh;\n            // 将子网格的顶点位置从当前本地空间转换为父对象的本地空间\n            combines[i].transform = obj.transform.worldToLocalMatrix * meshFilters[i].transform.localToWorldMatrix;\n        }\n\n        // 创建新网格并合并网格\n        Mesh mesh = new();\n        // indexFormat属性默认是Uint16，代表最多支持65535个顶点，如果超过65535个顶点，则此参数一定要设置为Int32\n        int totalVertices = 0;\n        foreach (var item in combines)\n        {\n            totalVertices += item.mesh.vertexCount;\n        }\n        if (totalVertices \u003e 65535)\n        {\n            mesh.indexFormat = UnityEngine.Rendering.IndexFormat.UInt32;\n        }\n        mesh.CombineMeshes(combines, true, true, false);\n        // 重新计算网格的包围盒和法线\n        mesh.RecalculateBounds();\n        mesh.RecalculateNormals();\n\n        // 存储合并完成的网格，路径可以通过配置文件存储\n        if (!Directory.Exists(Application.dataPath + \"/Mesh\"))\n        {\n            Directory.CreateDirectory(Application.dataPath + \"/Mesh\");\n        }\n        AssetDatabase.CreateAsset(mesh, \"Assets/Mesh/CombineMesh.asset\");\n        AssetDatabase.Refresh();\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250922203815-s950f8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922203815-s950f8o","updated":"20250926111903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设要合并如下的对象的网格："}]},{"ID":"20250926111904-980t9yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926111904-980t9yx","updated":"20250926111904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926111904-5w7rtkx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926111948-e7lmdao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926111948-e7lmdao","updated":"20250926112008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选择对象，在工具栏点击对应选项"}]},{"ID":"20250926111906-rzutt7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926111906-rzutt7c","updated":"20250926111946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926111946-scffosf.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926112009-9lcjrb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112009-9lcjrb1","updated":"20250926112035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来即可得到合并的网格对象："}]},{"ID":"20250926112036-nvhsm61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112036-nvhsm61","updated":"20250926112036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 426px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926112036-7fvsqsp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 426px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926112056-3ohafnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112056-3ohafnv","updated":"20250926112531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建一个空物体，添加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshFilter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ ，使用合并的网格，再添加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，关联一个材质，即可应用合并出来的网格"}]},{"ID":"20250926112406-3fjcjfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112406-3fjcjfh","updated":"20250926112510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926112510-wxd3d20.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926112841-p0epo39","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250926112841-p0epo39","updated":"20250926113740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更多优化思考"}]},{"ID":"20250926112852-bdejhw2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926112852-bdejhw2","updated":"20250926113740"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926112854-sw46sg6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926112854-sw46sg6","updated":"20250926113735"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926112854-iviee40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112854-iviee40","updated":"20250926112854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞器问题"}]},{"ID":"20250926112855-t0xsolr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112855-t0xsolr","updated":"20250926113735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于子物体的碰撞体，如果想要保留原碰撞体，我们可以不直接移除子物体，而是只移除子物体渲染相关的控件（例如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshFilter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250926112854-jz8dms5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250926112854-jz8dms5","updated":"20250926113740"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926112854-d05tlri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926112854-d05tlri","updated":"20250926112854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预设体问题"}]},{"ID":"20250926113042-49cb036","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926113042-49cb036","updated":"20250926113740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上文的编辑器环境存储合并网格，仅仅只包含了网格数据，而其他数据，例如碰撞体，依附脚本等信息等并没有保存，\n因此实际上可以在编辑器内创建包含合并网格信息的预制体，仅将子对象的渲染控件移除"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250926113026-qz9n623","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926113026-qz9n623","updated":"20250926113026"}}]}